OL,3,GNEWSAManslaughter charge after man
OL,4,Aattacked in street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmanslaughter after another man was
OL,8,Fattacked in the street.
OL,10,FThe 52-year-old was found unconscious
OL,11,Fon South Parade in Rochdale at 01:30
OL,12,FBST on Saturday and died later in
OL,13,Fhospital, Greater Manchester Police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FDougie Waring, 37, of Rochdale,
OL,17,Fappeared at Manchester and Salford
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court on Tuesday charged
OL,19,Fwith manslaughter. He was remanded in
OL,20,Fcustody and is next due to appear at
OL,21,FManchester Crown Court on 3 November.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
